vetting</h3>\r\n/tmp/site/en/index.html:56:<article class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-icon\">🔥</div><h3 class=\"card-title\">Claude Fable 5.1 — Anthropic's new Mythos-class flagship</h3><p class=\"card-desc\">A new frontier for coding, knowledge work and long-horizon agents. $10/$50 with $0.25 cache reads — up to ~45% cheaper in practice. 1M context, 128K output. Terminal-Bench-Science more than doubles Fable 5 (52.6%). Sister model <a href=\"/en/claude-mythos-5-1/\">Mythos 5.1</a> is trusted-access only.</p><a href=\"/en/claude-fable-5-1/\" class=\"card-link\">Fable 5.1 details →</a></article>\r\n/tmp/site/en/claude-opus-5-5/index.html:225:<tr><td class=\"model-name\"><a href=\"/en/claude-mythos-5-1/\">Claude Mythos 5.1</a></td><td>Dedicated page</td><td><strong>A different model (trusted-access tier for vetted organisations)</strong>. Opus 5.5&#39;s cyber and biology safeguards are the same class, and lifting them needs a verification program.</td></tr>\r\n/tmp/site/en/claude-fable-5-1/index.html:134:  <strong>Claude Mythos 5.1</strong> — trusted-access only. A version with relaxed safeguards in cybersecurity (CVP) and life sciences (LSVP) for vetted organizations. See the <a href=\"/en/claude-mythos-5-1/\">Mythos 5.1 page</a> for details.\r\n/tmp/site/en/timeline/index.html:66:<article class=\"tl-item dot-anthropic\" id=\"claude-fable-5-1\"><div class=\"tl-card\"><div class=\"tl-date\">2026-09-01 <span class=\"tl-provider-tag anthropic\">Anthropic</span></div><h2 class=\"tl-title\" id=\"sec-28\">Claude Fable 5.1 / Mythos 5.1 released — new Mythos-class flagship</h2><p class=\"tl-desc\">A new frontier for coding, knowledge work and long-horizon agents. Same model, different safeguards (Fable 5.1 generally available / Mythos 5.1 trusted-access only). Cache reads cut 75% ($1.00→$0.25). 1M context, 128K output. Terminal-Bench-Science 52.6% (more than double Fable 5's 24.7%). <span class=\"tl-price-badge\">$10/$50 · cache read $0.25</span></p><div class=\"tl-links\"><a